        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Circuit Gilles Villeneuve, Canada\n- Events: 2017 Canadian Grand Prix, Canadian Grand Prix, Formula One World Championship\n- People: Frank Gardner, Lewis Hamilton\n- Concepts: first win by a black driver\n\nFacts:\n- Circuit Gilles Villeneuve in Canada was the venue for the 2017 Canadian Grand Prix.\n- Circuit Gilles Villeneuve is the home of the Canadian Grand Prix in the FIA Formula One World Championship.\n- Frank Gardner was a racing driver in the Formula One World Championship.\n- Circuit Gilles Villeneuve hosted the first Formula One World Championship race won by a black driver.\n- Lewis Hamilton was the first black driver to win a Formula One World Championship race.",
