        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "de731701-ca01-5908-9451-688c3425dddb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2007 Canadian Grand Prix, 2017 Canadian Grand Prix\n- Places: Circuit Gilles Villeneuve, Montreal, Quebec, Canada\n- People: Lewis Hamilton, Frank Gardner\n- Organizations: FIA Formula One\n- Concepts: Formula One, Canadian Grand Prix, World Championship Formula One Grands Prix, European F5000 Championship\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Gardner debuted in World Championship Formula One Grands Prix on 11 July 1964 and later participated in nine such Grands Prix.\n- Frank Gardner was a European F5000 champion.\n- The 2007 Canadian Grand Prix was a Formula One motor race held on 10 June 2007 at Circuit Gilles Villeneuve in Montreal, Quebec, Canada.\n- Lewis Hamilton's victory in the 2007 Canadian Grand Prix was his first win in Formula One and made him the first black driver to win a Formula One race.\n- The 2017 Canadian Grand Prix was a Formula One motor race held on 11 June 2017 at Circuit Gilles Villeneuve in Montreal, Quebec, Canada.\n- Circuit Gilles Villeneuve is a motor racing circuit in Montreal, Quebec, Canada.\n- Circuit Gilles Villeneuve is the venue for the FIA Formula One Canadian Grand Prix.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
